<title>AUSTRIA: ALPINE SKIING-ZURBRIGGEN WINS WOMEN'S DOWNHILL.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-ZURBRIGGEN WINS WOMEN'S DOWNHILL.</headline>
<dateline>BAD KLEINKIRCHHEIM, Austria 1997-01-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland's Heidi Zurbriggen won a women's World Cup downhill race on Saturday, in a time of one minute 42.33 seconds, according to provisional results.  </p>
<p>German Hilde Gerg was second in 1:42.69 and Austrian Stefanie Schuster finished third in 1:43.06.</p>
